    <mdiv type="solesmes">
      <score>
        <section>
          <pb xml:id="m-7498ca8a-3395-4af7-ad4e-bcd6ec2b2a34" n="0747" facs="#m-3ec90c37-7ecf-40a3-916b-e71f9da75199" /><div xml:id="m-705b4c46-255e-4b70-b334-51aa18a4e68b">
            <lg xml:id="m-5b59c6cf-1bb7-46e5-b68c-7cbbf1deca75">
              <l xml:id="m-98b722cb-a5d6-4f81-a946-845f16857634" facs="#m-79d6a890-3631-4270-bf2b-252ca26ba9c9" label="text-like">At Mass</l><l xml:id="m-a3ae0d57-28a7-4a48-b1fe-9a545ad73979" facs="#m-4a2c5ffb-a5cc-4d79-b445-5ff09aa84768" label="ambiguous">sor</l><l xml:id="m-3bf09878-8c9f-444d-9dd4-479a007cdf0a" facs="#m-07faa2ee-9148-4e91-9543-be32e226ed42" label="lyrics-like">dimittere unum vinctum, quem ¡S. Ave, Rex Judacórum. C. Et</l><l xml:id="m-6efab7f4-361c-40f6-b11d-97727cff029e" facs="#m-0751db17-21ef-4b85-b4ca-ac7753f1436e" label="lyrics-like">voluíssent. Habébat autem tunc</l><l xml:id="m-cc43a5ec-3581-4c49-a69e-69d176e4a241" facs="#m-c0dae4db-4a9c-4f80-8a36-6ddd1633e7d1" label="lyrics-like">exspuéntes in eum, accepérunt</l><l xml:id="m-0489cf9c-6827-47c4-a04b-be150d638ef9" facs="#m-2faeb073-7052-43f9-bf19-ec653c34e50c" label="lyrics-like">arúndinem, et percutiébant ca¬</l><l xml:id="m-f3f61fcd-0aa3-4854-8602-fbdf6bd2f1cb" facs="#m-e0652455-a4cd-453c-96cc-afe21dce6639" label="lyrics-like">vinctum insignem, qui dicebátur</l><l xml:id="m-e201d099-7462-4bda-a7f4-6ea01de2983b" facs="#m-f6bf2c8e-eede-45e8-82a0-426b71f2d980" label="lyrics-like">Barábbas. Congregátis ergo illis,</l><l xml:id="m-ed139967-9af7-4dca-83e6-6cb16642acce" facs="#m-c0ad27c9-7a97-4730-834e-7aa4904c9cb9" label="lyrics-like">put ejus. Et postquam illusérunt</l><l xml:id="m-9408a9a8-a6ea-4034-8359-bf86c87f59fb" facs="#m-0048e433-1d7a-4010-af00-95295c188ce1" label="lyrics-like">ei, exuérunt eum chlámyde, et</l><l xml:id="m-5ee1f224-594d-4929-a0fb-69eba08098b1" facs="#m-848591a7-52c1-43b3-be09-46c741aa5caf" label="lyrics-like">dixit Pilátus: S. Quem vultis</l><l xml:id="m-e2dc84d3-aff6-48a9-98f2-bb13a57c5cad" facs="#m-c4aca88a-5647-471c-9fbd-d9bb95cb46bf" label="lyrics-like">induérunt eum vestiméntis ejus,</l><l xml:id="m-6e8b55e0-08fd-458b-aaf5-5e11bb08a44d" facs="#m-907bbcab-f44f-44f0-8079-dc23367bdcdb" label="lyrics-like">dimittam vobis : Barábbam, an</l><l xml:id="m-8e79331b-4e7a-42ca-a169-740b13bbfc2a" facs="#m-f4f63abf-932e-469f-a81b-a04720f38d8a" label="lyrics-like">et duxérunt eum ut crucifi¬</l><l xml:id="m-54b44cab-0e47-42e6-b032-8755ac0789c5" facs="#m-0cae32d5-805b-4406-8821-dcf84c4261f0" label="ambiguous">Jesum, qui dicitur Christus?</l><l xml:id="m-7934445d-de3a-4511-9eae-4b9fa12e6966" facs="#m-4c2cdac2-d07b-4e7c-8b52-2968640f9e96" label="lyrics-like">C. Sciébat enim quod per inví¬</l><l xml:id="m-297d69c0-2318-4e16-932b-7f633806591d" facs="#m-a28f0e4f-4ccc-4ea2-a792-4ae086d64e22" label="ambiguous">gerent.</l><l xml:id="m-915a8fdc-786f-4c62-9264-27209f665464" facs="#m-ea4aafe3-a410-4384-9e59-e9cbf1a9ab4d" label="lyrics-like">Exeúntes autem, invenérunt</l><l xml:id="m-a7815dcf-de2d-4181-ab36-458ef2c37867" facs="#m-14b0e586-b9b0-4e91-bafe-19ba05021e80" label="lyrics-like">diam tradidíssent eum. Sedénte</l><l xml:id="m-6c13b52a-ff00-4673-baa9-9e562e99d6aa" facs="#m-c33dad30-db47-4032-a1f7-ed8027db0d0b" label="lyrics-like">autem illo pro tribunáli, misit</l><l xml:id="m-99f351f3-707c-4b23-a87f-89ce83ea420f" facs="#m-9632e9f5-acd7-4901-82bf-6ec4cd0f0baa" label="lyrics-like">hóminem Cyrenaéum, nómine</l><l xml:id="m-134fde13-a69e-44d3-a389-9f205cf23429" facs="#m-6ce81588-64db-4302-b29a-b7be69193227" label="ambiguous">ad eum uxor ejus, dicens:</l><l xml:id="m-d23b3e87-a941-4c71-ad1f-9a66323ef276" facs="#m-3da4da61-8072-4290-9f3b-8be1591fa833" label="lyrics-like">Simónem : hunc angariavérunt,</l><l xml:id="m-b92ce4d6-8916-4afa-b227-69459de789b6" facs="#m-7cd59fdd-875e-45c8-889c-770025147fa3" label="ambiguous">S. Nihil tibi et justo illi : multa</l><l xml:id="m-8dbcb4e1-34cd-47c3-bb42-1a5624a3a182" facs="#m-f275992f-b48b-452c-9a32-6f9c9bebae31" label="lyrics-like">ut tólleret crucem eius. Et vené¬</l><l xml:id="m-b8ead892-bec6-411a-9ee7-8748bbf3b986" facs="#m-d2d926eb-87ea-4e29-8b4e-fa473c20e00e" label="lyrics-like">enim passa sum hódie per visum</l><l xml:id="m-1d1bf182-afd4-4f4c-a6f5-a689f036d5a0" facs="#m-76dc6c19-0bf7-478d-b887-86186df5f316" label="lyrics-like">runt in locum, qui dicitur Gólgo¬</l><l xml:id="m-8dc62fff-0c4c-4856-b6ca-92cf9aa8d877" facs="#m-eec7fbcb-cddc-46a7-b7ce-50448fd70d79" label="ambiguous">propter eum. C. Principes autem</l><l xml:id="m-7bd8bf87-1825-4827-a02a-4ef8968bdf7d" facs="#m-19999332-eeaa-463a-9ff7-84cd42d33552" label="lyrics-like">tha, quod est Calváriae locus.</l><l xml:id="m-cd66099e-b080-47b9-a81b-b5d22aab2921" facs="#m-c19621ea-7f9d-4ea4-80a8-44f94c5c61de" label="lyrics-like">Et dedérunt ei vinum bibere</l><l xml:id="m-6ca24566-ea6a-4a07-b974-454cf53af9f7" facs="#m-873710cd-1a5f-44e7-8750-c43f51e41a79" label="lyrics-like">sacerdótum, et senióres persua¬</l><l xml:id="m-67d10f07-696b-4063-a4cf-95e10bb69a7f" facs="#m-056052c2-1f7d-4d7c-b9a3-e4bc192a4cf9" label="lyrics-like">sérunt pópulis, ut péterent Ba¬</l><l xml:id="m-af8d381a-d7b2-47ed-afd5-ff1750a4ef38" facs="#m-ce223622-7226-4589-9a4f-620eca5dad74" label="ambiguous">cum felle mixtum. Et cum gu¬</l><l xml:id="m-c27d00f5-6923-4acb-b207-2488af194b85" facs="#m-0a9671d6-af97-4e44-b654-ee224af4895e" label="lyrics-like">stásset, nóluit bibere. Postquam</l><l xml:id="m-eb343cfb-704e-4467-904e-700cfe5d37c4" facs="#m-cd5b6e60-1249-4c31-aaff-80a192a49c16" label="lyrics-like">rábbam, Jesum vero pérderent.</l><l xml:id="m-456521a0-6d96-4a88-be59-e577c1b285fd" facs="#m-0fdc95b2-aeed-45cc-b8d2-126c71a53443" label="lyrics-like">autem crucifixérunt eum, divi¬</l><l xml:id="m-12f02f56-dbd2-4357-8f14-f1eacee94155" facs="#m-0d536507-11d1-417d-9137-ce7e237e4cab" label="lyrics-like">Respóndens autem praeses, ait</l><l xml:id="m-8ab55692-f5bd-447e-adcf-c6db5024991f" facs="#m-2f66cffe-131b-491a-b3f3-99b9f34cc923" label="lyrics-like">sérunt vestiménta ejus, sortem</l><l xml:id="m-91f8b357-836e-4c63-b3a5-cfd73c28f9e3" facs="#m-1181258d-2daf-4b25-b309-8f858736f15f" label="ambiguous">illis : S. Quem vuitis vobis de</l><l xml:id="m-49b2e49a-af63-48ea-9f40-20e325c2d3ee" facs="#m-7f8d8d2e-9426-4544-9e8a-133e43498179" label="lyrics-like">duóbus dimitti? C. At illi dixé¬</l><l xml:id="m-0ff8a266-8fbe-4eb9-be88-3380d4972660" facs="#m-c0f2aa93-f274-4bde-938c-9fb439555a11" label="lyrics-like">mitténtes : ut implerétur, quod</l><l xml:id="m-3176763b-060c-485e-85d2-662f5ce7dac9" facs="#m-83d23baf-b098-455f-86a9-e965407619ed" label="lyrics-like">runt: S. Barábbam. C. Dicit</l><l xml:id="m-c260b236-57ff-4914-8468-fbc22fe72a68" facs="#m-400cda08-042a-43ba-a2a1-5de80c671384" label="lyrics-like">dictum est per Prophétam, di¬</l><l xml:id="m-96f7a2cd-72e9-452c-8855-1ca31ac927da" facs="#m-2b5d34ac-d1e3-43ed-9149-13ef96d6ff88" label="lyrics-like">illis Pilátus: S. Ouid ígitur</l><l xml:id="m-cc8a527f-b9f2-43e7-88d4-f7b783fa0c0e" facs="#m-c138bcf0-bf84-4b7c-a42b-0c4af131e4ef" label="lyrics-like">céntem: Divisérunt sibi vesti¬</l><l xml:id="m-5ef665d6-70ab-4198-b48e-faf8ef756456" facs="#m-5d03a021-df0e-43de-ab9d-1e562f9a36b2" label="lyrics-like">fáciam de Jesu, qui dicitur Chri¬</l><l xml:id="m-9002128b-45bc-4c78-a392-dc494b5d2f86" facs="#m-4fae5df6-4660-4de7-a56a-4b9adbcc116c" label="lyrics-like">ménta mea, et super vestem</l><l xml:id="m-131856ca-0bbf-4794-9816-5c7700928dbf" facs="#m-5ae35b3a-4375-46ca-8802-bbb34ab0303b" label="ambiguous">stus? C. Dicunt omnes : S. Cru¬</l><l xml:id="m-14915027-484c-4885-a6ad-d02233514975" facs="#m-87974553-9b0f-4a90-8260-117b2e813cc5" label="lyrics-like">meam misérunt sortem. Et se¬</l><l xml:id="m-e303033e-b053-40fb-ad76-63dd0c6185d4" facs="#m-8bf6e1ce-5c5b-48a9-9ae7-18753b954088" label="lyrics-like">cifigátur. C. Ait illis praeses:</l><l xml:id="m-5f01d463-73fa-4f43-acd1-d85fe7ccea20" facs="#m-4547880d-5958-4fd0-bd8e-5eff2d7d5d91" label="lyrics-like">déntes, servábant eum. Et impo¬</l><l xml:id="m-0d88325c-64d9-4e10-8ea6-add89b44143f" facs="#m-e6faca0c-1409-4ac5-b864-ceadc3d54e48" label="text-like">S. Quid enim mali fecit? C. At</l><l xml:id="m-31b0d88e-4e8b-4843-9568-24ad3d7cab39" facs="#m-f8dbe066-07c1-4da9-8495-d35619072d70" label="lyrics-like">suérunt super caput ejus causam</l><l xml:id="m-34c7ee08-a6a0-48e1-8a53-729b763fe436" facs="#m-676bbde9-14d5-4296-bad6-0867f2df0281" label="lyrics-like">illi magis clamábant, dicéntes:</l><l xml:id="m-e688e239-02ea-4197-b2d4-72f06eaf3559" facs="#m-d21c782b-f054-4341-8b3a-b3822759e5a2" label="ambiguous">ipsius scriptam: Hic est Jesus</l><l xml:id="m-5ec600ea-54b1-4f91-a423-a15e80af8986" facs="#m-f0caba90-a294-4425-902e-2804b6e6ca23" label="lyrics-like">S. Crucifgátur. C. Videns au¬</l><l xml:id="m-f21a8335-9985-4649-b8c7-97dcc47214b6" facs="#m-ad9825b6-f3d2-4f2d-a709-068bd912f67d" label="lyrics-like">Rex Judacõrum.</l><l xml:id="m-501937f3-6cf9-4722-917c-924ff63cc423" facs="#m-b9689c63-f561-490c-92df-7992937a2014" label="ambiguous">Tunc crucifixi sunt cum eo</l><l xml:id="m-56516252-b4f1-428f-8ea6-b3e2d3b8161e" facs="#m-527ab634-9516-45ed-bd7e-42116f6ab4be" label="lyrics-like">tem Pilátus quia nihil proficeret,</l><l xml:id="m-f46e81f7-617a-4f8f-98f2-8e2d73996ead" facs="#m-ef87e817-53b4-4785-8ab2-dda0c31e5fcd" label="lyrics-like">sed magis tumúltus fieret</l><l xml:id="m-a61eb102-2e58-427b-b420-2c7729dd38be" facs="#m-3133f5d6-460b-4f00-b148-236c9b7eee9d" label="lyrics-like">duo latrónes: unus a dextris,</l><l xml:id="m-e0b07031-1f23-410e-9807-fc7c4229fbe3" facs="#m-7ed9fe64-2ffe-465f-9054-ae167e3a3dfd" label="lyrics-like">et unus a sinístris. Praetereuntes</l><l xml:id="m-fdeb526d-1c7f-436b-9109-d1ca0639d091" facs="#m-ea743bb9-2034-43fb-be77-12dd2daa9bb1" label="lyrics-like">accépta aqua, lavit manus coram</l><l xml:id="m-ba4ae8f0-1ad7-40da-b15f-697989192cf9" facs="#m-7286f302-04c1-4c9d-8918-8caa38239fa8" label="lyrics-like">pópulo, dicens: S. Innocens ego</l><l xml:id="m-e674022b-397a-42de-818b-7c874331a533" facs="#m-dfaf6bed-0f3e-4c25-9cbb-80c4c3baac96" label="lyrics-like">autem blasphemábant eum, mo¬</l><l xml:id="m-cf7a5df6-53d6-4946-991b-c876ac225961" facs="#m-4b67da73-1f1b-4559-afbb-36438e7a5b3f" label="lyrics-like">sum a sánguine justi hujus</l><l xml:id="m-3eb0e5cf-4f70-4a1e-9ea9-d308b1c30da4" facs="#m-db1c4da6-9661-4ccf-a9f3-6418b5500046" label="lyrics-like">véntes cápita sua, et dicéntes</l><l xml:id="m-2ef6017f-498e-41c2-bd32-6965a569fcc8" facs="#m-e7064f2e-c031-446f-aca1-316212bbf4fc" label="lyrics-like">vos vidéritis. C. Et respóndens</l><l xml:id="m-74e18bc7-f54e-4eca-a619-f23284822da7" facs="#m-269aaea1-88b8-4316-9830-f8bf9031adb2" label="lyrics-like">S. Vah, qui déstruis templum</l><l xml:id="m-cd30b2e6-fde3-4e4a-ae33-800dc6baae02" facs="#m-ea35ecea-8e96-48c9-8e51-42b5e5e33ae9" label="lyrics-like">univérsus pópulus dixit : S. San¬</l><l xml:id="m-ca212287-4906-4c39-8824-f21a852bc466" facs="#m-24f46b14-9a72-43da-9a47-6e56c54bd324" label="ambiguous">Dei, et in triduo illud reaedificas:</l><l xml:id="m-32151e16-7679-420a-ab70-165c7f6d41a3" facs="#m-7e470c30-002a-4530-b1da-5780bf2f5802" label="lyrics-like">salva temetípsum. Si Filius Dei</l><l xml:id="m-2d6d1bd1-733c-4c8f-ba18-7d954e49ba98" facs="#m-a72d8bd5-83df-4618-b03d-53f5fb2c16c0" label="ambiguous">guis ejus super nos, et super</l><l xml:id="m-3203b6cb-cc5c-4ee1-b41a-232eb915fa9b" facs="#m-32ad73fc-d932-41d5-bb3f-d9d00cc26321" label="lyrics-like">es, descénde de cruce. C. Simí¬</l><l xml:id="m-904f602a-fcaf-4b7b-9712-27702c9b74ab" facs="#m-d5e1cfe9-0bc2-464d-b9a2-7589cda2021e" label="lyrics-like">filios nostros. C. Tunc dimísit</l><l xml:id="m-a86e8344-61ef-4c6b-b362-2a2c10e5be01" facs="#m-880177e7-0f7f-4d40-9ece-64815529fb2d" label="lyrics-like">liter et principes sacerdótum</l><l xml:id="m-ffa661df-672a-4983-8df3-dbc1fff3b78c" facs="#m-2d3a3af1-f17c-46ba-a506-423cf33cfd17" label="lyrics-like">illis Barábbam: Jesum autem</l><l xml:id="m-9c96d5da-d791-4f5d-bdc8-0d50d99d95c2" facs="#m-24cdae47-b54d-4545-9531-92169d2b3f7f" label="lyrics-like">illudéntes cum scribis et senió¬</l><l xml:id="m-2b9fb3cf-146e-40b5-bfb0-94fb648bccc2" facs="#m-f490dd35-e7a1-4a18-8f8b-7f0c282747d3" label="lyrics-like">flagellátum trádidit eis, ut cru¬</l><l xml:id="m-c59367e3-e5d3-4eba-bcc6-bd216fdb72ad" facs="#m-6f4b966f-3ff7-43c6-a9ac-551451b31f63" label="lyrics-like">ribus, dicébant : S. Alios salvos</l><l xml:id="m-bb6d3ebc-1436-4ba4-b400-ae431cb39169" facs="#m-76a4c578-73af-4c19-99a8-8933cb34b652" label="lyrics-like">cifgerétur.</l><l xml:id="m-3683460e-8dff-4d02-a83b-10719774ea07" facs="#m-472f76d4-6584-4e1f-9c31-e3479952cb2d" label="lyrics-like">Tunc mílites praésidis susci¬</l><l xml:id="m-445ac450-da3d-4f38-b071-7ff8a616dc24" facs="#m-265869f2-fb24-410c-a54b-b7cb9ef1e972" label="lyrics-like">fecit, seípsum non potest salvum</l><l xml:id="m-847cc834-5d83-41aa-aa7b-9414332455e3" facs="#m-9d20b6a5-22c2-41eb-bd40-9e5142ee10d6" label="lyrics-like">piéntes Jesum in praetórium,</l><l xml:id="m-4f27067f-dec0-4a25-913c-a8069cefda06" facs="#m-f4673e1b-46fd-4e90-a7f9-acc624156ef8" label="lyrics-like">fácere: si Rex Israël est, descén¬</l><l xml:id="m-0617cd22-2439-48a4-aaf3-48e95b8dab96" facs="#m-10447723-54df-4902-8cec-4c52a0318ddd" label="lyrics-like">dat nunc de cruce, et crédimus</l><l xml:id="m-10941164-ca90-46ea-8d20-80bf2d50011d" facs="#m-a4a07737-a1af-40a2-a52b-fc6186aab092" label="lyrics-like">congregavérunt ad eum univér¬</l><l xml:id="m-fa9a1f08-d85f-498c-8996-d9abc46e3721" facs="#m-7a4faa42-32f1-4f78-8b7a-00a3b04d225e" label="ambiguous">ei: confidit in Deo: liberet</l><l xml:id="m-1fceef61-897c-435a-ae21-09b55f2cdacc" facs="#m-fadb81fa-836e-4303-a8c3-f498926a889a" label="lyrics-like">sam cohórtem: et exuéntes eum,</l><l xml:id="m-55f3e9cb-6585-422b-9db2-7fed1d5fac65" facs="#m-3af768c0-12ce-43ee-8821-5eeb0e7504a5" label="lyrics-like">chlámydem coccineam circum¬</l><l xml:id="m-db12acff-f887-43a0-a448-398e8bc107d3" facs="#m-bdc89ebc-7335-4bc8-b901-9642ce2c801a" label="ambiguous">nunc, si vult eum; dixit enim</l><l xml:id="m-998b325b-86a1-49c2-b381-db0a5f555164" facs="#m-b82e0311-d6b2-474a-bdcd-152eb12f086b" label="lyrics-like">dedérunt ei : et plecténtes coró¬</l><l xml:id="m-abeb1f9c-98f4-42b3-86a0-12a7f9337728" facs="#m-6102c3f6-e5ae-40d6-89bf-54932b091544" label="lyrics-like">Quia Filius Dei sum. C. Idípsum</l><l xml:id="m-4e86bd04-89ef-48fe-a952-36b94403e794" facs="#m-3d704b73-5284-4cab-8f42-79d317205c5c" label="lyrics-like">nam de spinis, posuérunt super</l><l xml:id="m-f7a77032-f5e0-46ac-aea0-7fe6b3dfeee9" facs="#m-abae5651-1238-4209-9252-05a3cf3e4a33" label="lyrics-like">autem et latrónes, qui crucifixi</l><l xml:id="m-4dda0e23-e53d-4c24-bf54-bc36d619c847" facs="#m-c8afd6ac-b937-47ab-a7eb-61eae6e61a6a" label="lyrics-like">caput ejus, et arúndinem in déx¬</l><l xml:id="m-d78fc7bb-f843-451c-a1c9-7497174c8346" facs="#m-b760ae28-d533-445d-8b2c-05fecf4f6920" label="lyrics-like">erant cum eo, improperábant ei.</l><l xml:id="m-a0d89be3-e364-43bb-b872-a74f9760dc7a" facs="#m-cabded1e-9100-4814-81ff-668e51737145" label="ambiguous">tera ejus. Et genu fexo ante</l><l xml:id="m-64469bfa-1088-427a-9b40-fd1d0a21e2c3" facs="#m-8bc909a6-b780-404e-b8dc-e9623fa3e809" label="lyrics-like">A sexta autem hora ténebrae</l><l xml:id="m-36c843f3-4b2c-4118-83f6-a2e27b551346" facs="#m-ddf10dea-1f62-47fb-a39d-6d48aea30aab" label="lyrics-like">eum, illudébant ei, dicéntes:</l><l xml:id="m-515bbf7f-3462-4e7c-a6cd-d09f83898925" facs="#m-f6de1888-386d-4c7d-817c-bd21c4ca2d6d" label="lyrics-like">factae sunt super univérsam</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
</mei>